WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.122 --> 00:00:17.971
It early morning at Dairy Dream Ice Cream Parlor.

2
00:00:18.811 --> 00:00:21.013
Miss Dipper, the owner, arrived at the store.

3
00:00:22.334 --> 00:00:24.195
She unlocked the door and turned on the lights.

4
00:00:27.738 --> 00:00:28.458
She gasped.

5
00:00:36.492 --> 00:00:37.012
"My ice cream is gone!"

6
00:00:37.032 --> 00:00:37.653
"I think I'm melting!"

7
00:00:37.673 --> 00:00:39.234
said Mara, wiping her forehead.

8
00:00:39.254 --> 00:00:41.155
"Don't talk," said Jack.

9
00:00:41.175 --> 00:00:43.677
"It only makes you feel hotter."

10
00:00:44.758 --> 00:00:47.840
The air conditioning at Metro City Elementary School wasn't working.

11
00:00:48.741 --> 00:00:51.263
The students in Miss Apricot's class were miserable.

12
00:00:52.884 --> 00:00:56.146
It was Quiet Reading Time, but no one could concentrate on reading.

13
00:00:56.166 --> 00:01:00.870
"It's so hot, I can't even think," said Terrell.

14
00:01:00.890 --> 00:01:03.892
"Me neither," said Jack.

15
00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:06.562
"I wish we could go swimming."

16
00:01:07.602 --> 00:01:11.185
Jack closed his eyes and imagined jumping into an ice-cold pool.

17
00:01:11.205 --> 00:01:17.250
"I wish we could have ice cream," said Mara.

18
00:01:17.270 --> 00:01:19.432
"That would cool us off."

19
00:01:19.452 --> 00:01:23.675
"If only Rocket Girl was here," said Terrell.

20
00:01:24.436 --> 00:01:26.338
"She could do something about this heat."

21
00:01:28.479 --> 00:01:31.522
"This heat isn't so bad," said Roxy.

22
00:01:31.542 --> 00:01:34.024
"Are you kidding?"

23
00:01:34.428 --> 00:01:35.029
asked Terrell.

24
00:01:35.049 --> 00:01:37.150
"Aren't you hot right now?"

25
00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:40.192
"Of course," said Roxy.

26
00:01:40.212 --> 00:01:43.955
"But I have a secret power I use to keep cool."

27
00:01:45.156 --> 00:01:46.317
Terrell looked interested.

28
00:01:47.798 --> 00:01:48.818
So did everyone else.

29
00:01:48.838 --> 00:01:50.620
"You do?"

30
00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:51.560
said Jack.

31
00:01:51.580 --> 00:01:53.261
"Tell us!"

32
00:01:54.222 --> 00:01:58.085
Terrell, Jack, and Mara leaned closer to hear about Roxy's secret power.

33
00:01:59.005 --> 00:02:00.406
Roxy looked very serious.

34
00:02:00.426 --> 00:02:02.308
"I'll tell you.

35
00:02:03.576 --> 00:02:07.539
But you all have to promise to never tell anyone," she said.

36
00:02:07.559 --> 00:02:12.382
"We promise," said her friends, hardly breathing.

37
00:02:12.402 --> 00:02:15.684
"Okay," Roxy whispered.

38
00:02:15.704 --> 00:02:18.186
"It's very simple.

39
00:02:19.347 --> 00:02:22.389
When it's really hot, I She paused.

40
00:02:23.630 --> 00:02:24.370
"You what?"

41
00:02:24.851 --> 00:02:25.451
asked Mara.

42
00:02:25.471 --> 00:02:26.952
"What do you do?"

43
00:02:28.213 --> 00:02:30.815
Roxy looked around to make sure no one else was listening.

44
00:02:31.835 --> 00:02:34.949
She whispered, "I try not to think about it."

45
00:02:38.270 --> 00:02:38.990
Roxy giggled.

46
00:02:40.910 --> 00:02:41.610
Jack groaned.

47
00:02:41.630 --> 00:02:45.211
"I thought you were going to tell us something good!"

48
00:02:47.012 --> 00:02:49.153
Miss Apricot looked up from the front of the room.

49
00:02:49.173 --> 00:02:53.234
"I know it's very hot," she said.

50
00:02:53.254 --> 00:02:56.114
"But please be quiet."

51
00:02:59.315 --> 00:03:02.729
"I still think Rocket Girl could stop this heat," whispered Terrell.

52
00:03:04.190 --> 00:03:06.131
Just then Roxy heard her watch beeping.

53
00:03:06.151 --> 00:03:09.413
"It's the mayor," she thought.

54
00:03:09.433 --> 00:03:14.016
"Miss Apricot," said Roxy.

55
00:03:15.057 --> 00:03:16.278
"May I go to the restroom?"

56
00:03:18.279 --> 00:03:20.241
A moment later Roxy was in the girls' room.

57
00:03:25.705 --> 00:03:28.486
Bloom," she said, looking at the screen on her watch.

58
00:03:28.506 --> 00:03:30.388
"What's the problem?"

59
00:03:31.328 --> 00:03:32.950
"Rocket Girl, we need your help!"

60
00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:34.071
said Mayor Bloom.

61
00:03:34.091 --> 00:03:37.014
"True Savings Bank is being robbed.

62
00:03:38.155 --> 00:03:39.536
I spoke with Principal Penn.

63
00:03:40.638 --> 00:03:43.681
She said you're excused from class until we solve the case."

64
00:03:43.701 --> 00:03:46.824
"I'm on my way," said Roxy.
